Spec 032, patch P-032-prod: spot with interchangeable instance types, prod's protected files.
Branch feat/032-spot-flexibility; built from plain copies of refs/heads/main (f1abe245) with diff -u.
Apply from the repository's root with: patch -p1 < docs/merge-requests/human-patches/2026-11-22-032-prod.patch

  infra/prod/ec2-market.tf   one spot launch template per listed type for each host (persistent, stop, a price
                             ceiling each); the two instances forgotten by removed blocks, never destroyed
  infra/prod/handover.tf     the four instance rules and EC2's ID's parameter read the current instances by tag;
                             the parameter's value is the start function's after its creation
  infra/prod/killswitch.tf   the server action's role names EC2 by tag; the budget action the instance read by tag
  infra/prod/edge.tf         the VPC origin's ARN from the tunnel end read by tag; the relay origin's DNS name from
                             the private interface

It needs the branch's unprotected files (ec2.tf, tunnel-end.tf, shared-state.tf, ssm.tf), which hold the type lists,
the template maps, and the two data sources.

